MODULE: AdmissionPrepareLost
TARGET: Converges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: Read progress loses a prepared entry and can never admit the complete batch
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
    /\ prepares' = IF read[k] = 0 /\ ~done THEN prepares \cup {k} ELSE prepares
--- REPLACE
    /\ prepares' = prepares
--- END
